{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_modular_monolith", "label": "Modular Monolith on Fly.io bom", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One deployable API means one Postgres transaction scope, no distributed sagas, one deploy pipeline and single-digit-ms internal calls \u2014 the only honest shape for a next-month launch run by AI agents."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_monorepo_layout", "label": "Monorepo Layout and Package Boundaries", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_dependency_direction", "label": "Dependency Direction Rule (dependency-cruiser enforced)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "packages/db and drizzle-orm are importable only from *.repository.ts so every query path is tenant-scoped by construction; a module reaches another only through its <m>.public.ts so a service-signature change cannot ripple across contexts."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_tenancy_model", "label": "Tenancy Model (tenant_id + app-layer scoping + RLS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_request_path", "label": "Request Path Anatomy (web, mobile, customer link)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_webhook_pipeline", "label": "Webhook Invariant Pipeline (verify \u2192 dedupe \u2192 enqueue \u2192 fast 2xx)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_background_processing", "label": "Background Processing (BullMQ queues and repeatables)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_realtime_sse", "label": "Realtime SSE Channels", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SSE chosen over WebSockets: unidirectional fan-out, no sticky sessions, auto-reconnect for free; WebSockets enter only if collaborative design editing lands."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_storage_tigris", "label": "Storage Architecture (Tigris, single-region pin sin)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No India region exists so sin is the nearest pin; DPDP Rules 2025 use a negative-list model permitting cross-border storage by default, and the DB holding primary PII stays in bom."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_design_studio_data_flow", "label": "Design-Studio Data Flow (the flagship path)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Visual meshes are never truth; everything derived is a pure function of the JSONB payload and is not persisted, so the studio's moat gets the strictest invariants."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_fingerprints", "label": "Nested Design Fingerprints (siteFp \u2282 geometryFp \u2282 layoutFp \u2282 electricalFp \u2282 designFp)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This mechanism IS the 'money never renders while stale' rule: a quote whose designFp no longer matches reads as provisional, enforced at the API rather than in the UI."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_one_frame_gate", "label": "One-Frame Gate (panelInstanceMatrix single composition)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_market_packs", "label": "Market Packs (rules + catalog + templates + locale)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "India-first, global-ready means concretely that no market fact is ever a module-level constant \u2014 contexts are injected parameters and dependency-cruiser blocks any other import path."}, {"id": "docs_02_system_architecture_extraction_seams", "label": "Extraction Seams (module boundaries = future service boundaries)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/02-system-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Do not extract anything before a scaling or isolation reason exists; billing and agent are the first candidates because every module surface is already a ts-rest contract slice."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_02_system_architecture_modular_monolith", "target": "docs_03_tech_stack_nestjs", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/02-